rm and onboard train announcements, from scripts written by Dovetail Games staff. See which parts of Train Sim World® 7 use AI."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678800/73a59941a9b184a9c0b1e82de09be79dfeb332a7/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1792077072"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/index-9dDQvLNP.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/layers-3cLAEgxw.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/_slug-Dda2UhF1.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/LayerStrip-AdBcUwO6.js"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="anonymous"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://howmuchai.games/game/train-sim-world-7"/></head><body><header class="site-header pad"><div class="wrap nav"><a class="logo" href="/"><span class="logo-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>HowMuchAI</a><nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main"><a href="/ai">Browse</a><a href="/developers">Developers</a></nav><form role="search" class="search " action="/search" method="get"><label class="sr-only" for="q-sm">Search Steam games</label><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"></path></svg><input id="q-sm" type="search" placeholder="Search games" autoComplete="off" enterKeyHint="search" name="q"/></form></div></header><main class="pad"><div class="wrap"><!--$--><article class="game"><p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/ai">Browse</a> / <!-- -->Train Sim World® 7</p><header class="game-head"><div><h1>Is <!-- -->Train Sim World® 7<!-- --> AI generated?</h1><p class="meta"><a href="/developer/dovetail-games">Dovetail Games</a><span>Sep 15, 2026</span><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4678800/" rel="nofollow noopener">Steam page ↗</a></p><p class="verdict">ElevenLabs text-to-speech generates some voice-over, such as training modules and platform and onboard train announcements, from scripts written by Dovetail Games staff.</p><p class="flag">The disclosure hedges how much was made with AI (&quot;some&quot;, &quot;certain assets&quot;).</p></div><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678800/73a59941a9b184a9c0b1e82de09be79dfeb332a7/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1792077072" alt="Train Sim World® 7 header image" width="460" height="215"/></header><section class="label" aria-labelledby="label"><div class="label-head"><h2 id="label">AI by part, from the developer&#x27;s disclosure</h2><span class="mono mute">1 of 9 parts mention AI</span></div><ul class="label-cells"><li><a href="/ai/art"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Art</span><span class="lstatus">Not mentioned</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/store-page"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Store page</span><span class="lstatus">Not mentioned</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/voice"><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Voice</span><span class="lstatus">AI-generated</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/music"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Music</span><span class="lstatus">Not mentioned</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/sound-effects"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Sound effects</span><span class="lstatus">Not mentioned</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/writing"><span class="cell none " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Writing</span><span class="lstatus">Says no AI</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/translation"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Translation</span><span class="lstatus">Not mentioned</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/code"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Code</span><span class="lstatus">Not mentioned</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/live-generation"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Live generation</span><span class="lstatus">Not mentioned</span></a></li></ul></section><div class="cols"><section aria-labelledby="disclosure"><h2 id="disclosure">What the developer wrote</h2><blockquote>We are utilising ElevenLabs’ text-to-speech tool, to generate some voice-over elements within Train Sim World 7. This is utilised in features such as training modules, as well as platform and onboard train announcements. All scripts and content are written by Dovetail Games staff, with ElevenLabs used to generate the audio in these instances.</blockquote><p class="source">Steam &quot;AI Generated Content Disclosure&quot; · first seen <!-- -->Oct 26, 2026<!-- --> · last checked<!-- --> <!-- -->Nov 1, 2026</p></section><section aria-labelledby="parts"><h2 id="parts">Part by part</h2><table class="layers"><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/art">Art</a><span>In-game art, sprites, textures, 3D models</span></th><td><span class="chip not_mentioned"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span>Not mentioned</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/store-page">Store page</a><span>Capsules, screenshots, trailers, store text</span></th><td><span class="chip not_mentioned"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span>Not mentioned</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/voice">Voice</a><span>Voice acting and narration</span></th><td><span class="chip generated"><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span>AI-generated</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/music">Music</a><span>Soundtrack</span></th><td><span class="chip not_mentioned"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span>Not mentioned</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/sound-effects">Sound effects</a><span>Sound effects and ambience</span></th><td><span class="chip not_mentioned"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span>Not mentioned</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/writing">Writing</a><span>Story, dialogue, item and quest text</span></th><td><span class="chip none"><span class="cell none " aria-hidden="true"></span>Says no AI</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/translation">Translation</a><span>Localized versions</span></th><td><span class="chip not_mentioned"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span>Not mentioned</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/code">Code</a><span>Programming and tooling</span></th><td><span class="chip not_mentioned"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span>Not mentioned</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/live-generation">Live generation</a><span>Content generated while you play</span></th><td><span class="chip not_mentioned"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span>Not mentioned</span></td></tr></tbody></table><div style="margin-top:16px"><ul class="legend"><li><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span><span>AI-generated</span></li><li><span class="cell assisted " aria-hidden="true"></span><span>AI-assisted</span></li><li><span class="cell unclear " aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Mentioned, unclear</span></li><li><span class="cell none " aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Says no AI</span></li><li><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Not mentioned</span></li></ul></div></section></div><section aria-labelledby="reports"><h2 id="reports">Player reports</h2><div class="soon"><p>Played <!-- -->Train Sim World® 7<!-- -->? Soon you&#x27;ll be able to sign in with Steam and report what you saw in each part.</p><p>Reports from players with the game in their library will sit next to the developer&#x27;s disclosure, never replace it.</p></div></section></article><!--/$--><